# Optional local environment hints.
# Do not put real tokens in committed files.

# Hugging Face login is normally done via:
# huggingface-cli login

# Optional cache locations:
# HF_HOME=C:\hf-cache
# TRANSFORMERS_CACHE=C:\hf-cache\transformers
# HF_DATASETS_CACHE=C:\hf-cache\datasets

